text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House1_Text_08184EBA {
    "Do you nickname your POKéMON?\nI gave a cool name to mine.\pBut when I call my POKéMON by that\nname, people laugh at me...\pIf it’s okay with you, want to trade\nyour {STR_VAR_1} for my {STR_VAR_2}?"
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House1_Text_08184F6B {
    "Eheheheh, ooh, this is so exciting!"
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House1_Text_08184F8F {
    "But that’s no {STR_VAR_1}.\nTch, that’s so disappointing..."
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House1_Text_08184FC1 {
    "Aww, it’s a good POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House1_Text_08184FDD {
    "Don’t you get curious about what other\npeople named their POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_TrovitaIsland_House1_Text_08185020 {
    "In all sorts of places, there are all\nsorts of POKéMON and people.\pI find that fascinating, so I go to all\nsorts of places."
}
